{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/01/28/4814495/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日たまたま収録のお弁当で出ました。\nこれぞ引き寄せの法則！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガパオって知らない人多いのね。\nタイ料理よ！\nおいしいからぜひ食べてみて(^^)b"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう\n言ってなかったけど、この間の3人の写真は\nいま発売中のLARMEのオフショットだよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/01/28/4814495/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもはできないヘアメイクや衣装☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/01/28/4814495/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/01/28/4814495/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方にも一瞬だれかわからなかったって言われたから\nぜひ探してみて～(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにこれは未公開ショット。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/01/28/4814495/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別人みたいでしょー笑\n色とか髪型ちがうと印象すごい変わるものですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このあと22時からは残念な夫。3話！\nみてね～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}